                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If the employee is unable to return to work after twenty-four (24) months of approved medical leave of absence the employee will be placed on a medical layoff and eligible for COBRA benefits.",
            "block_bbox": [
                147,
